    description: "UAT 2026-04-13 UX-06: JSON behavior map node IDs contain absolute paths (`go:/home/user/repos/...`), making output non-portable across machines. The `path` field correctly uses repo-relative paths and stable_id/shape_id are also available, but the primary ID is absolute. Switch primary ID to repo-relative; this is a schema-compat-affecting change — coordinate with Appendix C of docs/hypergumbo-spec.md."  # fd1a
